{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Pulse",
  "theme": "pulse",
  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "Pulse cluster: a full-screen city map. The top bar holds the next turn (or a WAZE MAP label), the shift lights and now playing; the bottom bar holds the drive mode, fuel and range, the huge speed and gear, the clock and outside temperature, and the Ankara weather line. With \"Show Waze map inside the theme\" on, the Waze map fills the whole background and the bars sit over it; off, a dark stylised map is drawn. Theme decorations and the DEMO tag come from the engine; no oil, coolant, torque or power readouts. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
